1
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,200
Die, dog emperor!

2
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,480
Protect His Majesty!

3
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,240
Han'er, here.

4
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:18,760
Daoist Master,

5
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,360
Meng Qian,

6
00:01:19,440 --> 00:01:20,900
escort His Majesty first.

7
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:21,960
Your Majesty.

8
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,570
Catch the sword!

9
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,040
Zhu Zitong!

10
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,160
How are you?

11
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,160
Zhu Zitong!

12
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,560
Zhu Zitong!

13
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,680
Lord Chu.

14
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,320
I'm afraid

15
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,640
I can no longer

16
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,160
protect you

17
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,440
in the future, My Lord.

18
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,200
Zhu Zitong!

19
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,920
My Lord.

20
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,520
Father,

21
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,800
the candy is so sweet.

22
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,000
She looks

23
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,480
so much like my daughter.

24
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,770
His Majesty is fine.

25
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,000
Your Majesty.

26
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:37,280
My brothers in Liangshan

27
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:40,840
are willing to surrender to the imperial court.

28
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,240
This is the letter of surrender

29
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:44,500
written by my brother Gongming himself.

30
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,600
Please take a look, Your Majesty.

31
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:55,600
That the Liangshan brothers

32
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,159
can realize their errors

33
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,440
and sincerely surrender

34
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,960
makes me very pleased.

35
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:03,770
Mr. Zhou.

36
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,480
If we can escort His Majesty down the West Tower,

37
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,210
will there be reinforcements?

38
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,760
Even if the guards downstairs are completely wiped out,

39
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,240
as long as the signal fire is lit,

40
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:15,440
the Imperial City Division will arrive in a quarter of an hour at most.

41
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,880
May I ask where the fireworks are?

42
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,520
On the first floor,

43
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,580
the leftmost room.

44
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:19,360
Okay.

45
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,840
Then His Majesty

46
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:23,100
is left to Mr. Zhou and the Taoist Master.

47
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:24,920
Please.

48
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:52,000
The Zhao Song royal family favors corrupt officials and sycophants.

49
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,440
Endless wars

50
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:55,520
have displaced the common people,

51
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,380
causing unspeakable suffering.

52
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,000
Will your Liangshan

53
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:02,440
really make an enemy of us Shedao people for this man?

54
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,370
The matter of surrender

55
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:14,080
was a choice made by all the brothers of Liangshan.

56
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,380
Regardless of right or wrong,

57
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:18,920
our Liangshan

58
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,960
has a clear conscience.

59
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:29,480
What a clear conscience!

60
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,640
You!

61
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,200
Your Majesty.

62
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,720
Your Majesty.

63
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,800
Your Majesty.

64
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:15,040
Guards!

65
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:16,880
Somebody, hurry!

66
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,040
Meng Qian,

67
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,000
go set off the signal.

68
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,080
Hurry!

69
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:02,440
Sister.

70
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:06,920
Why are you doing this?
